DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T001500
SUMMARY:(H.B.G.) - Harrisburg Board Gaming 
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\nCome to game night in the Harrisburg are
 a! Every 2nd and 4th Friday of every month\, there will be gaming at the L
 ife Point Church. Event starts at 6:00pm in the Churches Lobby / Sitting A
 rea and goes until you're too tired to play anymore.\n\nFeel Free to bring
  your own games\, food and drinks! We have a kitchen available to be used 
 and a Fridge for your drinks. Come check us out.\n\nJon Krehling is the or
 ganizer of this event\, so message him on meetup if you have any questions
 !
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/308160924/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20250530T160235Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250530T160235Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
UID:event_314699930@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260706T041536Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T200000
SUMMARY:2nd Saturday Gaming - Colonial Park United Church of Christ
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\n**COVID Notice**\nIf you are fully vacci
 nated\, no mask is required. If not\, you are required by the church to we
 ar a face mask. If you're not vacced and not willing to wear a mask then p
 lease do not attend.\n\nhttp://www.centralpagameclub.com/images/entrance.j
 pg\n\nCard and board games covering a huge gamut of themes - anything from
  developing islands\, staging cruises\, casting movies\, to building railr
 oads. There are themes appealing to every audience and most games play in 
 45-90 minutes. Our friendly members are happy to teach. Many games are beg
 inner-friendly and can be taught in about 10 minutes.\n\nAdults 16 & older
 .\n\nNewcomers are welcome.\n\nVisit http://www.centralpagameclub.com for 
 more information.\n\nWhen you enter the church's parking lot\, park in the
  back\, come in through the courtyard\, and look for the door in the pictu
 re above.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/314699930/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260509T163020Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260509T163020Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
